### 🟡 Phase 1 — 신원과 핵심 소유권 (부분 완료)

#### 완료된 부분

| 영역 | 파일 |
|------|------|
| **Auth UI routes** | `login.tsx`, `register.tsx`, `forgot-password.tsx`, `reset-password.tsx` |
| **Auth server routes** | `api/auth/session.ts`, `api/auth/$.ts` (catch-all), OAuth callback |
| **Auth tRPC procedures** | `lib/auth-trpc.ts` — login, register, logout, password change |
| **Organization service** | `packages/domain/src/organization-service.ts` + spec |
| **Project service** | `packages/domain/src/project-service.ts` + spec |
| **Enrollment service** | `packages/domain/src/enrollment-service.ts` + spec |
| **Project/Org authorization** | `project-authorization.ts`, `organization-service.ts` |
| **Issue authorization** | `packages/domain/src/issue-authorization.ts` |
| **Repository authorization** | `packages/domain/src/repository-authorization.ts` |
| **Asset authorization** | `packages/domain/src/asset-authorization.ts` |
| **Organization routes (UI)** | `routes/organizations/$organizationName/`, `routes/organizations/new.tsx` |
| **Project routes (UI)** | `routes/projects/` 존재 |
| **DB: org-project schema** | `packages/db/src/org-project.ts` (25KB) — 풍부한 스키마 |
| **DB: auth-users schema** | `packages/db/src/auth-users.ts` |
| **DB: attachment-assets** | `packages/db/src/attachment-assets.ts` |
| **DB: repository-access** | `packages/db/src/repository-access.ts` |
| **Contracts: auth, org, project, repo** | `packages/contracts/src/` |
| **Organization tRPC** | `lib/organization-trpc.ts`, `enrollment-trpc.ts` |
| **Project tRPC** | `lib/project-trpc.ts` |
| **API token route** | `api/me/token.ts` |

#### ⚠️ Phase 1 미완성 부분

| 영역 | 상태 |
|------|------|
| `/me`, `/me/settings` UI route | 미구현 (UI 없음) |
| `/users/$loginId` public profile | 미구현 |
| 사용자 즐겨찾기/최근 방문 | DB 스키마 및 tRPC 미구현 |
| 알림 설정 | 미구현 |
| 사이드바/알림 피드 API | `api/me/` — token만 있고 sidebar/notifications/favorites/recent 없음 |
| Avatar/logo upload flow | asset upload + binding 미구현 |

