---

### ❌ 미구현 영역 (Phase 2–6)

| Phase | 영역 |
|-------|------|
| Phase 2 | Issue CRUD, IssueComment, Label, Milestone, watch/vote/share, 첨부파일 |
| Phase 2 | Asset upload/finalize (`POST /api/uploads`, `POST /api/uploads/:uploadId/finalize`) |
| Phase 3 | Repository Browser UI, commit history UI, branch list UI |
| Phase 3 | Raw file route, commit comments/discussion thread |
| Phase 4 | Pull Request 전체, 리뷰어, 리뷰 스레드, 병합 |
| Phase 5 | Search (global/org/project), Board/Discussion, Notification, Integration |
| Phase 5 | Inbound mailbox, email threading |
| Phase 6 | Site Admin, Migration tool, llms.txt, AI datasource |

